PARITY MAPPING (web → Apple platform tokens; no Tailwind ported)
  nav.flex.overflow-x-auto    → ScrollView(.horizontal, showsIndicators:false) + HStack(spacing: TSSpacing.xs)
  <Home h-3.5 w-3.5/>         → SF Symbol "house" in a hover link (text-muted → text-secondary)
  <ChevronRight/>            → SF Symbol "chevron.right" (decorative → a11y-hidden)
  PrefetchLink (ancestor)    → BreadcrumbHoverLink: Button(.plain) muted→secondary on hover, trait .isLink
  current text-secondary     → plain Text, Font.TS.body.weight(.medium), Color.TS.textSecondary, trait .isHeader
  hidden sm:inline + sm:hidden … → horizontalSizeClass==.compact (iOS) collapses middle crumbs to "…"
  text-[var(--text-muted)]   → Color.TS.textMuted ; --text-secondary → Color.TS.textSecondary
  truncate max-w-[200px]     → lineLimit(1) + truncationMode(.tail) + frame(maxWidth: 200)
  ROUTE_META + PARENT_OVERRIDES → BreadcrumbRouteGraph.table (all 12 overrides + parents; routeRegistry labels)
  useBreadcrumbs chain-walk  → BreadcrumbsProjection.trail (override>i18n>default, {{param}}/:param, no-href leaf,
                               cycle-guard, [] on unmatched) — unit-tested
  items.length <= 1 ⇒ null   → BreadcrumbsPhase.hidden ⇒ EmptyView (intentional empty slot)
  i18n      : every string via the P1/S10 facade (LayoutBreadcrumbsStrings, table "LayoutBreadcrumbs"); zero
              English literals in Swift. a11y.breadcrumb/a11y.breadcrumbHome carried from web en.json; the 19
              route labels carried verbatim from routeRegistry.ts.
  a11y      : the trail is a contained landmark whose label is the localized "Breadcrumb" role + the full trail
              (so VoiceOver hears every crumb even when middle items are visually collapsed); links carry .isLink,
              the current crumb carries .isHeader + a "current page" hint; chevrons/ellipsis are decorative;
              Dynamic Type via the type tokens; hover/press only (no motion to gate).
  telemetry : view.opened surface="LayoutBreadcrumbs" via BreadcrumbsModel.start (P1/S11), default OSLog sink.
  states    : loading (nav unresolved) / hidden (web self-suppress) / error (resolution failure, retry) /
              breadcrumbs (the trail), plus the P4 leaf freshness axis live / stale (tappable chip + one-shot
              auto-refresh) / offline (informative chip).

